days 0
walk random
# ticks 500
# mctas mobfarm tail-bench <design> --seed 1 (pattern of 8 cycles, extra 0), design shifted by 0,0, from cycle 6 (the scene holds the tail's carts as they were then)
# start: Run::start(spec, RunOpts { ai: true, ..steady(seed, ticks, Random) }); settle_tick until false; spawn the design's entity lines in order; t0 = the time right after that spawn (the scene file holds only the tail's carts, as the bench keeps them); act t applied when the time is t0 + t, before the next tick
